+# Spinwait 16 ms acceptance — 2026-09-02
+
+## Verdict
+
+Keep `GLM53_SPINWAIT_MS=16` as the opinionated TP2 default. It improved the
+primary delivered-throughput metric on the real four-stream 33K staggered
+workload and had already won the frozen decode sweep.
+
+## Byte-equivalent C4 gate
+
+Both runs used image digest
+`sha256:107d899515629f168fdd5f7bac3e967bc3d0fe768124bafd9322c7a3a8c4adc4`,
+vLLM `0.1.dev47+g6a49e49e7`, mixed scheduling, MNBT 7,168, DFlash2 K7/TP2,
+FP8 target KV, FP16 sparse-indexer scores, four requests arriving at
+0/1/2/3 seconds, about 33K prompt tokens each, and exactly 400 output tokens
+per request. The candidate changed only the shared-memory reader spin window.
+A restart between runs cleared prefix cache state; both captures used the same
+prompt salt and reported prompt-token counts 32,999 / 33,002 / 33,002 / 33,001.
+
+| Metric | Stock 1 s | 16 ms | Change |
+| --- | ---: | ---: | ---: |
+| Wall time | 158.071 s | **154.041 s** | **-2.55%** |
+| Delivered throughput | 10.122 tok/s | **10.387 tok/s** | **+2.62%** |
+| Aggregate decode | 13.188 tok/s | **13.990 tok/s** | **+6.08%** |
+| TTFT lane 1 | **37.048 s** | 39.954 s | +7.84% |
+| TTFT lane 2 | **62.939 s** | 65.624 s | +4.27% |
+| TTFT lane 3 | **91.078 s** | 91.766 s | +0.76% |
+| TTFT lane 4 | **112.572 s** | 112.775 s | +0.18% |
+
+All requests completed without errors. This is accepted as a throughput and
+host-efficiency improvement, not a TTFT improvement. Earlier frozen TP2 decode
+testing measured +0.95% median decode throughput and 85.3% less active
+EngineCore CPU versus stock; 2, 32, and 64 ms candidates lost.
+
+Artifacts:
+
+- `sparkglm-artifacts/spinwait-stock-control-23dd3b9676.json`
+- `sparkglm-artifacts/spinwait16-candidate-23dd3b9676.json`
diff --git a/recipes/mia/.env.example b/recipes/mia/.env.example
index 0766fb3920..e4d1b76d0a 100644
--- a/recipes/mia/.env.example
+++ b/recipes/mia/.env.example
@@ -168,7 +168,7 @@ GLM53_PHASE_PREFILL_TOKENS=2048
 GLM53_INDEXER_WORKSPACE=rightsize
 # SpinCondition reader busy-loop window: stock keeps vLLM's 1 s default;
 # 1..1000 selects milliseconds. This deployment's frozen sweep selected 16.
-GLM53_SPINWAIT_MS=stock
+GLM53_SPINWAIT_MS=16
 # EngineCore execute timeout (seconds). Stock 300 is short for a cold JIT.
 # VLLM_EXECUTE_MODEL_TIMEOUT_SECONDS=1800
 
diff --git a/recipes/mia/README.md b/recipes/mia/README.md
index 44430440d4..d04c08946a 100644
--- a/recipes/mia/README.md
+++ b/recipes/mia/README.md
@@ -512,7 +512,7 @@ that are now documented/enforced:
 | `GLM53_PHASE_PREFILL_TOKENS` | `2048` | maximum tokens in each prefill-only slab; the live scheduler budget may impose a lower cap |
 | `GLM53_SUPPRESS_STOPS_IN_REASONING` | `1` | ignore client `stop` strings until `</think>` (thinking-on default) |
 | `GLM53_INDEXER_WORKSPACE` | `rightsize` | sparse-indexer prefill gather workspace sized to the legal per-step maximum. `stock` reserves `max_model_len * 40` entries (**5036.40 MB** at 1M); right-size reclaimed ~4.9 GiB/rank in the C4 parity run |
-| `GLM53_SPINWAIT_MS` | `stock` | SpinCondition reader busy-loop window. `stock` preserves vLLM's 1 s default; `1..1000` selects milliseconds. A frozen TP=2 sweep selected `16` (+0.95% median decode vs stock, 85.3% less active EngineCore CPU) |
+| `GLM53_SPINWAIT_MS` | `16` | SpinCondition reader busy-loop window. `stock` preserves vLLM's 1 s default; `1..1000` selects milliseconds. A frozen TP=2 sweep selected `16` (+0.95% median decode vs stock, 85.3% less active EngineCore CPU); the mixed C4 33K gate improved delivered throughput 2.62% |
 | `GLM53_BOOT_SHAPE_WARMUP` | `1` | after `/health`, burn DFlash2 BLOCK / sampler / kpool shapes (nonfatal) |
 | `TRITON_HOST_CACHE` / `TILELANG_HOST_CACHE` | `$CACHE_ROOT/triton` / `tilelang` | persist JIT caches across container recreate |
 | `LANGUAGE_MODEL_ONLY` | `0` | load vision tower (image + video) |
diff --git a/recipes/mia/start.sh b/recipes/mia/start.sh
index 06fa4df0cf..63a7f8d842 100755
--- a/recipes/mia/start.sh
+++ b/recipes/mia/start.sh
@@ -286,7 +286,7 @@ GLM53_PHASE_PREFILL_TOKENS="${GLM53_PHASE_PREFILL_TOKENS:-2048}"
 GLM53_INDEXER_WORKSPACE="${GLM53_INDEXER_WORKSPACE-rightsize}"
 # SpinCondition reader busy-loop window. "stock" preserves vLLM's 1 s default;
 # 1..1000 selects milliseconds. The frozen TP=2 sweep selected 16 ms.
-GLM53_SPINWAIT_MS="${GLM53_SPINWAIT_MS-stock}"
+GLM53_SPINWAIT_MS="${GLM53_SPINWAIT_MS-16}"
 # EngineCore stock timeout is 300s; mid-serve Triton/TileLang JIT on TP=2 can
 # exceed that without being a true hang. NCCL watchdog is still 600s.
 VLLM_EXECUTE_MODEL_TIMEOUT_SECONDS="${VLLM_EXECUTE_MODEL_TIMEOUT_SECONDS:-1800}"
